ds-pstack
=========

This package vendors the complete upstream pstack skill corpus and adds a
DeepSeek Harness (DSH) adapter around it.

Upstream work
-------------

  Repository : https://github.com/cursor/plugins
  Path       : pstack/
  Commit     : ae5650febf4320793844c12c4adaa937f417f8da
  Author     : Lauren Tan
  License    : MIT (see LICENSE)

All files under `skills/` in this package are copied byte-for-byte from
`pstack/skills` at that commit. No byte in that tree has been modified: no
frontmatter edits, no inserted pointer lines, no tool-name rewrites. Integrity
is recorded per file in `skills.manifest.json` and can be re-checked with
`node scripts/check-vendor.mjs`.

The vendored tree contains 58 skill directories and 535 files, including the
playbooks, references, scripts and test corpora those skills reference.

