New work in this repository
---------------------------

The following paths are original to this project and are licensed under the
same MIT terms:

  lib/            DSH skill provider and frontmatter reader
  docs/harness/   DSH adapter guide (tools, subagents, models, paths, semantics)
  scripts/        vendor integrity check and provider smoke test
  cordis.patch.yml, package.json, README.md, NOTICE, skills.manifest.json

The adapter guide is our own writing. It maps Cursor names to DSH names and
documents one deliberate semantic override: upstream
`disable-model-invocation: true` is surfaced as `modelInvocable: true` at
runtime, because the DSH `skill` tool is the only load path and disabling it
would break every `poteto-mode` route. Upstream values are preserved verbatim
in each skill's `metadata.upstream` and the vendored files are untouched.
